This repository holds two kinds of material and licenses them separately, which is
the usual arrangement for a paper repository: Creative Commons recommends against
applying CC licenses to software, because they carry no patent grant and no
source-distribution terms, while CC BY 4.0 is the natural fit for data and prose.

