================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY AND UPSTREAM MATERIAL
================================================================================

Neither license above extends to material this repository does not own:

- Human donor data from the seven snRNA-seq cohorts and the Xenium dataset
  remains governed by the agreements of the consortia that produced it (PsychAD,
  NIMH/NDA, Synapse, and the individual brain banks). The donor-level tables
  committed here carry de-identified demographic variables only, released with
  PI authorisation; they are not a grant of rights over the underlying data.
- Reference atlases (Allen Institute SEA-AD, MERFISH), GWAS summary statistics,
  and gene-set collections (MSigDB) carry their own terms from their providers.
- Third-party packages called by this code are licensed by their own authors.
